{"hw":"ἀνέλεγκτος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀνέλεγκτος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀνέλεγ-κτος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">not cross-questioned, safe from being questioned,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.85</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἡ γλῶττα ἀ. ἡμῖν ἔσται, ἡ δὲ φρὴν οὐκ ἀ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tht.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">154d</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phlb.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">41b</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">not refuted,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἐᾶν τινὰ ἀ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Grg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">467a</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἵνα μοι καὶ ἀ. ἡ μαντεία γένοιτο</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">irrefutable,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22a</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ti.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">29b</span> </span>. <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-τως, λεγόμενον</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">without refutation</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">reply,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">CG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> of persons also, <b class=\"lex-tr\">without trial,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. διαφυγεῖν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.53</span> </span>.</div></div>"}